            <ArticleTitle>Successful retrieval of a lost coronary stent from the descending aorta using a loop basket intravascular retriever set.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>224-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Delivery of a balloon-expandable stent was complicated by a systemic embolisation. The radio-opaque stent was lost in the descending aorta, but then removed by using a loop basket intravascular retriever set without any peripheral arterial complication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
